On a Nokia 7750, I’m trying to make sure that any active LDP /32s that the router is actually forwarding traffic for get shared with a neighbor using BGP, using those specific label encodings from the old IETF standard for BGP label stuff (the one before carrier-carrier became trendy). How do I force this to happen even if BGP already knows other routes for the same address while setting up a new traffic engineering setup?
