To configure a strictly basic IPv4 BGP session with the legacy device at 192.0.2.1, use these CLI commands. Replace `65000` with the actual AS number of the legacy peer.

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        neighbor 192.0.2.1
            peer-as 65000
