```

**Explanation:**  
This configuration enables unlabeled IPv6 BGP routes to resolve next-hops using any available tunnels (like RSVP or LDP) in the Tunnel Table Manager (TTM). The `resolution any` setting allows the system to automatically leverage pre-established tunnels for next-hop resolution, bypassing the default behavior of using IGP paths.
