2. List multiple tunnel types in `resolution-filter` (e.g., `resolution-filter rsvp sr-policy`) if tagged LSPs span multiple protocols.  
3. Ensure admin tags are applied to the relevant LSPs in their respective configurations (e.g., MPLS LSPs or SR policies).
