- Ensure peers support the same or higher `hold-time`; otherwise, the negotiated timer defaults to the peer’s lower value.  
- Use `damp-peer-oscillations` parameters (e.g., `idle-hold-time`, `max-wait`) to fine-tune suppression penalties if needed.  
