To configure BGP graceful restart on a Nokia 7750 SR with the forwarding-state flag enabled only for specific services (Layer 2 VPNs, route targets, and flow-specific IPv4/IPv6 routes), while excluding regular IPv4/IPv6 routing tables, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
